{"html":"<p>The Rust toolchain ships with the two tools that matter most (fmt, clippy), and\nthe community has built excellent ones for everything else. This module is the\n\"make it production-grade\" checklist.</p>\n<h2 id=\"rustfmt--formatting\"><code>rustfmt</code> — formatting</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">                  # format everything</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --all</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --check</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"> # CI: fail if not formatted</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><code>rustfmt.toml</code> — note that most options are <strong>nightly-only</strong>:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># rustfmt.toml  (stable options)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">edition = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"2021\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">max_width = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">100</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># nightly-only — run with `cargo +nightly fmt`</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">imports_granularity = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"Module\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">group_imports = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"StdExternalCrate\"</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Rule of thumb:</strong> do not fight rustfmt. Its default output is what every Rust\ndeveloper reads fluently, and diff noise from manual formatting is a real cost\nin review.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"clippy--the-linter\"><code>clippy</code> — the linter</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> clippy</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --all-targets</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --all-features</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> warnings</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> clippy</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --fix</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --allow-dirty</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">     # auto-apply machine-applicable lints</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Clippy has ~750 lints in groups:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Group</th>\n<th>Meaning</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>correctness</code></td>\n<td>almost certainly a bug (on by default)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>suspicious</code></td>\n<td>probably a bug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>style</code></td>\n<td>idiomatic alternative</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>complexity</code></td>\n<td>needlessly convoluted</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>perf</code></td>\n<td>a faster way exists</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pedantic</code></td>\n<td>stricter, sometimes noisy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nursery</code></td>\n<td>unstable, experimental</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo</code></td>\n<td>manifest problems</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">lints</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">clippy</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">all = { level = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"warn\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, priority = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">-1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">pedantic = { level = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"warn\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, priority = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">-1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">module_name_repetitions = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"allow\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">must_use_candidate = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"allow\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">missing_errors_doc = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"allow\"</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Start with <code>all</code>, add <code>pedantic</code> selectively. Enabling all of <code>pedantic</code> on a\nreal codebase produces hundreds of <code>module_name_repetitions</code> warnings and people\nstart ignoring clippy, which is the worst outcome.</p>\n<h3 id=\"lints-worth-knowing-by-name\">Lints worth knowing by name</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>unwrap_used</code>, <code>expect_used</code> — ban panics in library code</li>\n<li><code>todo</code>, <code>unimplemented</code> — never ship these</li>\n<li><code>dbg_macro</code>, <code>print_stdout</code> — ban debug output in a server</li>\n<li><code>arithmetic_side_effects</code> — catch overflow risks</li>\n<li><code>cast_possible_truncation</code> — catch lossy <code>as</code></li>\n<li><code>large_enum_variant</code> — a variant 10× bigger than the others</li>\n<li><code>redundant_clone</code> — an unnecessary allocation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"cargo-deny--supply-chain-policy\"><code>cargo-deny</code> — supply chain policy</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> install</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo-deny</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># deny.toml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">advisories</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">vulnerability = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"deny\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">unmaintained = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"warn\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">licenses</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">allow = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"MIT\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"Apache-2.0\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"BSD-3-Clause\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"ISC\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"Unicode-3.0\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">bans</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">multiple-versions = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"warn\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">deny = [</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    { name = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"openssl-sys\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> },   </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># force rustls instead</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">sources</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">unknown-registry = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"deny\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">unknown-git = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"deny\"</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> deny</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> check</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>This is the one CI step that stops a compromised or GPL-licensed dependency from\nreaching production.</p>\n<h2 id=\"cargo-audit--known-vulnerabilities\"><code>cargo-audit</code> — known vulnerabilities</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> install</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo-audit</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> audit</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> audit</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --json</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Reads the RustSec advisory database. Run it on a schedule in CI, not just on\npush — new CVEs appear for dependencies you did not change.</p>\n<h2 id=\"cargo-mutants--does-your-test-suite-actually-test\"><code>cargo-mutants</code> — does your test suite actually test?</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> install</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo-mutants</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> mutants</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>It mutates your source (flips <code>&#x3C;</code> to <code>&#x3C;=</code>, replaces a return value) and checks\nwhether a test fails. A surviving mutant is an untested behaviour. This finds\nthe \"tests that assert nothing\" problem better than coverage does.</p>\n<h2 id=\"miri--undefined-behaviour-detection\"><code>miri</code> — undefined behaviour detection</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> rustup</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> +nightly</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> component</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> miri</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> +nightly</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> miri</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> test</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>An interpreter for Rust's MIR that catches UB your tests would miss: out-of-bounds\nreads, use of uninitialised memory, data races, invalid <code>unsafe</code>. Slow — run it\non the <code>unsafe</code>-heavy crates only.</p>\n<h2 id=\"cargo-geiger--unsafe-usage-audit\"><code>cargo-geiger</code> — unsafe usage audit</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> install</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo-geiger</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> geiger</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Counts <code>unsafe</code> in your code and your dependency tree. Useful when evaluating a\nnew crate.</p>\n<h2 id=\"cargo-semver-checks\"><code>cargo-semver-checks</code></h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> install</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo-semver-checks</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> semver-checks</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> check-release</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Detects breaking changes in your public API that a version bump does not declare.\nEssential for a library.</p>\n<h2 id=\"cargo-release-and-cargo-dist\"><code>cargo-release</code> and <code>cargo-dist</code></h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032