musl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">    steps</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">      - </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">uses</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">      - </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">uses</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">dtolnay/rust-toolchain@stable</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">        with</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: { </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">targets</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"${{ matrix.target }}\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">      - </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">cargo build --release --target ${{ matrix.target }}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Three jobs worth having that people skip: <strong>MSRV</strong> (proves your <code>rust-version</code>\nis honest), <strong>cross</strong> (proves the <code>cfg</code> blocks compile), and <strong>deny</strong> (supply\nchain).</p>\n<h2 id=\"pre-commit-hooks\">Pre-commit hooks</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> install</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo-husky</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">// in dev-dependencies</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">husky </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> { version </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> \"1\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, default</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">features </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> false</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, features </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"precommit-hook\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"run-cargo-fmt\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"run-cargo-clippy\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">] }</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Or with <code>lefthook</code> / <code>pre-commit</code>:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"yaml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"yaml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># lefthook.yml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">pre-commit</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">  commands</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">    fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">      run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">cargo fmt --all -- --check</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">    clippy</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">      run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"the-order-to-fix-things-in\">The order to fix things in</h2>\n<p>When you inherit a messy Rust repo, do this in order — each step makes the next\ncheaper:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>cargo fmt</code> — one huge diff, then never again.</li>\n<li><code>cargo clippy --fix</code> — automatic, safe.</li>\n<li><code>cargo clippy -D warnings</code> in CI.</li>\n<li><code>cargo deny check</code> in CI.</li>\n<li><code>cargo nextest</code> for speed.</li>\n<li>Coverage or <code>cargo-mutants</code> to find untested code.</li>\n<li><code>cargo-audit</code> on a schedule.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"exercises\">Exercises</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Add <code>[lints.clippy]</code> to a project with <code>all = \"warn\"</code> and <code>unwrap_used = \"warn\"</code>, then fix the fallout.</li>\n<li>Run <code>cargo clippy --fix</code> on a project with a few style lints and review the\ndiff before committing.</li>\n<li>Write a <code>deny.toml</code> that allows only MIT/Apache-2.0/BSD-3-Clause and bans\nduplicate major versions of any crate as an error.</li>\n<li>Run <code>cargo audit</code> and, if it reports anything, evaluate whether it applies to\nyour usage.</li>\n<li>Add the three-job CI workflow above to a real repo and get it green.</li>\n<li>Explain why <code>RUSTFLAGS: \"-D warnings\"</code> in CI is both useful and dangerous.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Next:</strong> <a href=\"05-performance-profiling.md\">Performance and profiling</a></p>"}